# Normalize all text files to LF line endings on checkin, regardless of the
# committer's OS or editor settings, to prevent CRLF from creeping back in.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Treat Sail and Whisper model configs as JSON with Comments on GitHub.
**/sail.json linguist-language=JSON-with-Comments
**/whisper.json linguist-language=JSON-with-Comments
